        "title": "The plans below show a harbour in 2000 and how it looks today. Sumarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The plans below show a harbour in 2000 and how it looks today. </strong></em></span><em style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Harbour Layout: 2000 vs Today</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">Đề b&agrave;i Harbour Layout: 2000 vs Today y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về bố cục của Cảng Porth v&agrave;o năm 2000 với hiện tại.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Harbour Layout: 2000 vs Today với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: bố cục của một cảng biển - năm 2000 v&agrave; hiện tại.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U7iadbsa0o9CMOxYDBClUkAhgse\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZYodOsfSod6E5xJw0Flch6wgZd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>c&oacute; một số thay đổi đ&aacute;ng kể tại cảng n&agrave;y, đặc biệt l&agrave; trong việc sắp xếp chỗ cho <em>c&aacute;c cơ sở vật chất t&agrave;u thuyền (boat facilities)</em> v&agrave; sự ph&aacute;t triển của <em>c&aacute;c tiện &iacute;ch mới (new amenities)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XS6XduQ67oL350xRUvOlsoiKgob\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>sự thay đổi đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; nhất l&agrave; việc chuyển đổi l&acirc;u đ&agrave;i th&agrave;nh kh&aacute;ch sạn, c&ugrave;ng với việc bổ sung <em>c&aacute;c cơ sở thương mại (commercial facilities).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c sự thay đổi dựa tr&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; <strong>về mặt địa l&yacute;</strong>:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FKLxd8T0jomlW3xlEQ5lfJGxgwb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> khu vực ph&iacute;a đ&ocirc;ng bắc của cảng</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xz8Sd3833oJVsmxgnsUlprJUgUb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vw50dZaq3oF2ZIxm3TBlq500gRe\">(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả khu vực ph&iacute;a đ&ocirc;ng bắc của cảng </strong><strong>5 năm trước</strong>:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JUA4dxEvgohR9ZxnhsblIGlIgJf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>c&oacute; một <em><strong>bến cảng (dock)</strong></em> phục vụ <em>kh&aacute;ch qua ph&agrave; (passenger ferries)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PcKbdkvyNoYKcfxcLnflaBuogPh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>một <em><strong>b&atilde;i biển c&ocirc;ng cộng (public beach)</strong></em> <em>nằm (be located)</em> dọc theo bờ biển ph&iacute;a đ&ocirc;ng.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MlX8dHCreoaAIXx2VHXlgT9ugNh\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả khu vực ph&iacute;a đ&ocirc;ng bắc của cảng </strong><strong>ở hiện tại</strong>:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D5hBdcWaxoptvfxYWxgl49IDgzd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>khu vực bến cảng được mở rộng với th&ecirc;m 2 c&aacute;i bến cảng mới song song với nhau để cung cấp <em>dịch vụ qua ph&agrave; (ferry services)</em> tốt hơn.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QAqbdgf1XoxA29xoXCMlDEHgg6A\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>b&atilde;i biển c&ocirc;ng cộng <em>kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; g&igrave; thay đổi (remain unchanged).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;BODY</span><strong>&nbsp;2:</strong><strong> khu vực ph&iacute;a t&acirc;y v&agrave; ph&iacute;a nam của cảng</strong></span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrA9dgGjNoRCVUxfgJ1lOWFlglh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IkHudzeJ4oBsktxrxaeld0Dcgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả khu vực ph&iacute;a t&acirc;y v&agrave; ph&iacute;a nam của cảng </strong><strong>5 năm trước</strong>:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P4tHdz1hUolSqWxwKZrl2KT7g8t\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>c&oacute; một <em><strong>bến du thuyền (marina)</strong></em> cho <em><strong>du thuyền tư nh&acirc;n (private yatchs)</strong></em><strong>, </strong>một số<strong> </strong><em><strong>cơ sở nh&agrave; tắm v&agrave; nh&agrave; vệ sinh (showers and toilets)</strong></em><strong>, </strong>v&agrave; <em>hai</em><em><strong> b&atilde;i đổ xe (car parks)</strong></em><strong> </strong>dẫn đến <em><strong>con đường ch&iacute;nh (main road).</strong></em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DpUedAbEIotdF1x6VAClL5NNgXb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><em><strong>c&aacute;c t&agrave;u đ&aacute;nh c&aacute; (fishing boats)</strong></em> được đặt ở một khu vực ri&ecirc;ng, <em><strong>một trạm cứu hộ (lifeboat station)</strong></em> được đặt dọc theo bở biển ph&iacute;a nam, v&agrave; c&oacute; một c&aacute;i <em><strong>l&acirc;u đ&agrave;i bỏ hoang (disused castle)</strong></em> đứng ở cuối <em><strong>b&aacute;n đảo</strong></em><strong> </strong><em><strong>(peninsula)</strong></em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NtzkdMhGco10OhxizWKlFrxEgSb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả khu vực ph&iacute;a t&acirc;y v&agrave; ph&iacute;a nam của cảng </strong><strong>ở hiện tại</strong>:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QTPed1g1hoylwox5mXFltXnvgQf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>bến du thuyến được di dời về ph&iacute;a nam<strong>, </strong>c&aacute;c t&agrave;u đ&aacute;nh c&aacute; cũng được chuyển đến gần khu vực<strong> </strong>bến cảng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SJnfdN6cAojMiJxcqNElQWGqgId\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>một <em>khu phức hợp</em> <em>(complex)</em> gồm <strong>cafes</strong> v&agrave; <strong>shops</strong> được x&acirc;y dựng giữa trạm cứu hộ v&agrave; bến du thuyền</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OjjQdIttzoj5euxiFxTl4qv6glc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>l&acirc;u đ&agrave;i<strong> </strong>được đổi th&agrave;nh <em><strong>kh&aacute;ch sạn (hotel)</strong></em>, v&agrave; cũng c&oacute; một con đường nhỏ được x&acirc;y ri&ecirc;ng cho kh&aacute;ch sạn đ&oacute;.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VO1TdpZweonKopxclTTlE6upg1e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">c&aacute;c nh&agrave; tắm v&agrave; nh&agrave; vệ sinh cũng được x&acirc;y dựng th&ecirc;m để đ&aacute;p ứng số lượng kh&aacute;ch tham quan ng&agrave;y c&agrave;ng tăng.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1632,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OBOXdm5imoAdnkxm7y5lNO97ghb\">The maps compare the layout of Porth Harbour in 2000 with the present day.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18138,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1633,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bq0Ad2GiAoZdqIxm4hxlLCYXg4e\">Overall, several significant changes have been made to this harbour, particularly in the arrangement of boat facilities and the development of new amenities. The most notable transformation is the conversion of the castle into a hotel, along with the addition of commercial facilities.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18138,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1634,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JBAWdcrLCoO837x5k04lDcpPglM\">Looking at the northeast section in 2000, there was a dock to serve passenger ferries, and a public beach located along the eastern shoreline. In the present-day layout, the dock area has been extended with two additional docks to provide better ferry services, while the public beach remains unchanged.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18138,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1635,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UpPpdMZ7UoyMu7xysPnlD75KgZf\">Regarding the western and southern areas, in 2000, these sections featured a marina for private yachts, some shower and toilet facilities, and two car parks connected to the main road. Some fishing boats were stationed in a dedicated area, and a lifeboat station was positioned along the southern shore, with a disused castle standing at the peninsula's end. Up to the present, the marina has been relocated southward, and fishing boats have been moved closer to the dock. A new complex of cafes and shops has been established between the lifeboat station and the marina. The most substantial change is the transformation of the castle into a hotel, with a new access road designated for hotel use only. Additional shower and toilet facilities have also been constructed to accommodate increased visitor numbers.</div>\n</div>",
